21264 (EV6 and later), but not in the 21164 (EV5), so far I as I
was able to determine...

BTW, if anyone has data on the 21264 CPUs (and later) and the
systems that use them, I'd love to fill out the later information
in Alpha's intro(4).

	Erik <fair@netbsd.org>



